  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given ellipse is&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> … <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0,4</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0012_f99de924548e.png\" style=\"width:1.64653in;height:1.36667in\" /><br />Let, the tangent to the ellipse be&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>25</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></msqrt></math> where,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> is a parameter.</p><p>Now, the sum of the squares of <math><mo>⊥</mo></math>&nbsp;distances on this tangent from the points&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>'</mo></msup></math> is<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>25</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>25</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>25</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></math></p>"
